<title>ITALY: Italy's Mediolanum mulls share buy back.</title>
<headline>Italy's Mediolanum mulls share buy back.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian financial services group Mediolanum said in a statement it was planning to buy back up to 2.5 million of its own shares.</p>
<p>The plan, which is subject to the approval of shareholders at a meeting planned for April 29, would allow the board to buy back the shares for a period of 18 months in order to carry out &quot;stabilising activities&quot; on the stock market.</p>
<p>(( --Milan bureau +392 66219507))</p>
